<!-- ===== SECTION 4: FAQ with JSON-LD Schema ===== -->
<section class="py-16 px-4 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
  <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-8 text-center">
    Frequently Asked Questions
  </h2>
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
      <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-900 p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
        How do I find government tenders in South Africa?
        <span class="ml-2 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-gray-700">
        Government tenders are published on the eTender Publication Portal, departmental websites, and various tender notice boards. You can also use aggregated platforms like tenderpreneurs to monitor opportunities across all provinces and sectors.
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
      <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-900 p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
        What is eTenders and how does it work?
        <span class="ml-2 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-gray-700">
        eTenders is the South African government’s official electronic tender portal where public sector contracts are advertised. Suppliers can search for tenders, download bid documents, and sometimes submit bids online.
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
      <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-900 p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
        How do I register on the Central Supplier Database?
        <span class="ml-2 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-gray-700">
        Visit the CSD website, complete the online registration form, upload the required supporting documents (such as tax clearance certificate, B-BBEE certificate, and bank confirmation letter), and submit for verification.
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
      <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-900 p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
        What is PFMA compliance?
        <span class="ml-2 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-gray-700">
        PFMA stands for the Public Finance Management Act. It sets out the financial management and procurement rules that government entities must follow to ensure transparency, fairness, and value for money in tender processes.
      </div>
    </details>
    <details class="group bg-white rounded-xl shadow-sm border border-gray-200">
      <summary class="flex justify-between items-center font-semibold text-gray-900 p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
        How are B-BBEE points calculated for tenders?
        <span class="ml-2 transition-transform duration-200 group-open:rotate-180">
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-gray-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/></svg>
        </span>
      </summary>
      <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-gray-700">
        B-BBEE points are awarded based on your verified scorecard. Typically, 10 or 20 points are allocated to B-BBEE status level in the total tender evaluation, with higher levels earning more points. The exact calculation depends on the specific tender’s Preferential Procurement regulations.
      </div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

